# Pixelsmith vendored assets.
#
# Format: <target-path>|<url>|<license>|<sha256 or "PENDING">
#
# Every binary that ships inside the offline bundle is listed here with a pinned
# checksum. fetch-assets.sh refuses to proceed on a mismatch: on an air-gapped
# deployment nobody can re-download a corrupted or substituted model later, so
# the integrity check has to happen on the build machine, once, loudly.
#
# Licences are recorded because this ships into an environment where every
# component has to be accounted for. Nothing copyleft, nothing research-only.

